  "label": "Pastor Sheriff",
  "description": "A Black American pastor and former police officer, known for his public advocacy for law enforcement and his controversial statements on race and crime. His name is a play on 'Pastor' (his religious role) and 'Sheriff' (his law enforcement role), referencing his dual identity and public stance. This reference is critical to understanding the meme's implication of political or cultural 'sellout'.",
